Stores questions on your tier's accepted cards, once the tier has reached its target. Each is on one card: an MCQ with 3 to 5 distinct options and the index of the right one, counting from 0, or free text with a reference answer and a rubric giving each level 0 to 3 as "0: ...", "1: ...". Every accepted card needs a question that passes. Code refuses a stem that repeats another's meaning, and names every fault at once.
